因为我觉得现在我有能力去尝试很多、很多事情，去看看哪些能成，看看在我的工作流中什么行得通，并从中学习。
Because I also feel like I've been enabled to try out many, many things and try out and see what sticks and see kind of what in my own way of working works, and also learn from that.

882
01:14:04,976 --> 01:14:05,616
是的。
Yeah.

